{"id":"n61987-1-8","stage":4,"title":"뻔히 · 清楚","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61987-1-8-1","ko":"한 번만 봐주세요.","zh":"就饶我这一次吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한","meaning":"界限 ，穷尽","explanation":"한：界限 ，穷尽","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84551","senseId":"2","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"번만","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번만","audio":"/audio/eac56da1e92dec880f79.mp3"}},{"text":"봐주세요.","meaning":"照顾，看，看护；表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","explanation":"보다：照顾，看，看护；주다：表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"10","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐주세요","audio":"/audio/0d364a91f427af7e8a25.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"界限 ，穷尽","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"84551","definition":"表示前面表达的内容程度太过分。","pronunciation":["한ː"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"次，遍","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"计算事情次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"照顾，看，看护","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"保护或照料某人。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/860fceecdda67fb88d5c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61987-1-8-2","ko":"또 잘못을 할 게 뻔히 보이는데 어떻게 넘어가니?","zh":"明摆着你还会再犯，怎么能放过你？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"잘못을","meaning":"错，错误","explanation":"잘못：错，错误；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62477","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못을","audio":"/audio/58e969a89e094287fa0a.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"(贬称)人或动物。","explanation":"것：(贬称)人或动物。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"2","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"뻔히","meaning":"清楚，明显","explanation":"뻔히：清楚，明显","readings":[{"term":"뻔히","audio":"/audio/759380db99a791301ffc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61987","senseId":"1","lemma":"뻔히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뻔히","audio":"/audio/759380db99a791301ffc.mp3"}},{"text":"보이는데","meaning":"显露，露出","explanation":"보이다：显露，露出；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"2","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이는데","audio":"/audio/9605d72ec6eda39718b1.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"넘어가니?","meaning":"过关，放过","explanation":"넘어가다：过关，放过；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"넘어가다","audio":"/audio/c8ec62583dd73fe6463e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65551","senseId":"15","lemma":"넘어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘어가니","audio":"/audio/80169ea693b4d3eff45b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"cd1c34de004dbb0d","term":"잘못","zh":"错，错误","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3","entryId":"62477","definition":"做不好或做错的事。","pronunciation":["잘몯"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"(贬称)人或动物。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"(贬称)人或动物。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"759380db99a79130","term":"뻔히","zh":"清楚，明显","audio":"/audio/759380db99a791301ffc.mp3","entryId":"61987","definition":"某件事的结果或状态等非常分明，一目了然。","pronunciation":["뻔ː히"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"显露，露出","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"观察对象而了解其内容或状态。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"c8ec62583dd73fe6","term":"넘어가다","zh":"过关，放过","audio":"/audio/c8e